            "end_line": 22,
            "line_count": 3,
            "preview": "// largest number of minutes that won't overflow when converted to seconds int maxMinutes = Integer.MAX_VALUE / SECONDS_PER_MINUTE; assertEquals(maxMinutes * SECONDS_PER_MINUTE, Seconds.ofMinutes(maxMinutes).getAmount());"
